<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
    <title>About Us | Narsimha Astro</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --maroon: #631a2a;
            --gold: #c99a46;
            --cream: #fff9ef
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: var(--cream);
            color: #39231f;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif
        }

        header {
            background: var(--maroon);
            color: white;
            padding: 16px 7%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap
        }

        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            color: #ffd58a;
            font: bold 23px Georgia, serif;
            text-decoration: none
        }

        .brand img {
            width: 55px;
            height: 55px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 15px
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px
        }

        nav a:hover,
        nav a.active {
            color: #ffd58a
        }

        .banner {
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #541422, #842b39);
            padding: 85px 7%;
            text-align: center;
            color: white
        }

        .banner h1 {
            font: bold clamp(34px, 5vw, 58px) Georgia, serif;
            margin: 0 0 16px
        }

        .banner p {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: auto;
            line-height: 1.7
        }

        .content {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 65px 7%
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
            gap: 24px
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid #eadac2;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 28px #5122190c
        }

        .card h2,
        .content h2 {
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            color: #631a2a
        }

        .card p,
        .content p {
            line-height: 1.75;
            color: #665650
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: #631a2a;
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 23px;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #842b39
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin: 14px 0 7px
        }

        input,
        textarea,
        select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #d6c8b7;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font: inherit
        }

        textarea {
            min-height: 120px;
            resize: vertical
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            background: #37141c;
            color: #e5cdbb;
            padding: 28px 7%;
            font-size: 14px
        }

        .video {
            aspect-ratio: 16/9;
            background: #f4e8d4;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            color: #631a2a;
            font-size: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px
        }

        @media(max-width:750px) {
            header {
                justify-content: center
            }

            nav {
                justify-content: center
            }

            .grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr
            }

            .banner {
                padding: 65px 7%
            }
        }
    </style>
    <style id="responsive-navigation">
        header {
            display: flex !important;
            align-items: center !important;
            justify-content: space-between !important;
            flex-wrap: wrap !important;
            gap: 16px !important;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 20
        }

        header .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            min-width: 0;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #ffd58a;
            font: bold clamp(15px, 1.8vw, 23px) Georgia, serif;
            white-space: nowrap
        }

        header .brand img,
        header .header-logo {
            width: 58px !important;
            height: 58px !important;
            object-fit: contain !important;
            border-radius: 5px !important;
            flex-shrink: 0
        }

        header .site-nav {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            gap: clamp(8px, 1.5vw, 24px);
            flex-wrap: nowrap
        }

        header .site-nav a {
            display: block;
            margin: 0 !important;
            padding: 10px 3px !important;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font: 500 15px Arial, sans-serif;
            white-space: nowrap
        }

        header .site-nav a:hover,
        header .site-nav a[aria-current="page"] {
            color: #ffd58a
        }

        .menu-toggle {
            display: none;
            background: transparent;
            border: 1px solid #e3b35e;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: #ffd58a;
            padding: 9px;
            cursor: pointer;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center
        }

        .menu-toggle svg {
            width: 25px;
            height: 25px;
            display: block
        }

        @media(max-width:800px) {
            header {
                padding: 12px 5% !important
            }

            .menu-toggle {
                display: flex;
                margin-left: auto
            }

            .site-nav {
                display: none !important;
                position: static !important;
                top: auto;
                left: auto;
                right: auto;
                width: 100%;
                flex-basis: 100%;
                order: 3;
                background: #541422;
                padding: 12px 5% 20px;
                box-shadow: 0 12px 20px #21000633;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: stretch !important;
                gap: 0 !important
            }

            .site-nav.is-open {
                display: flex !important
            }

            .site-nav a {
                padding: 15px 12px !important;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff20;
                font-size: 16px !important
            }

            header .brand img,
            header .header-logo {
                width: 48px !important;
                height: 48px !important
            }
        }

        @media(max-width:360px) {
            header .brand {
                font-size: 14px !important
            }

            header .brand img,
            header .header-logo {
                width: 42px !important;
                height: 42px !important
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <header><a class="brand" href="index.html"><img class="header-logo" src="/images"
                alt="Narsimha Astro logo"><span>NARSIMHA ASTRO</span></a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button"
            aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="site-navigation"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round">
                <path d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16" />
            </svg></button>
        <nav class="site-nav" id="site-navigation" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a
                href="/contact">Contact Us</a><a href="/about" aria-current="page">About Us</a></nav>
    </header>
    <main>
        <section class="banner">
            <h1>About Us</h1>
            <p>Discover the vision behind Narsimha Astro and our commitment to traditional Jyotish knowledge.</p>
        </section>
        <section class="content">
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>Who We Are</h2>
                    <p>Narsimha Astro is an emerging platform focused on connecting people with knowledgeable
                        astrologers through chat, voice and video consultations.</p>
            
                </div>
                <div class="card">
                    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
                    <p>To create an approachable space for learning about Vedic astrology, Kundli analysis, Vastu,
                        numerology and related traditions.</p>
                    <p>We value respectful conversations, thoughtful guidance and continuous learning.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card" style="margin-top:24px;text-align:center">
                <h2>Explore Narsimha Astro</h2>
               <a class="btn"
                    href="/consultation">Explore Services</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>
    <footer>© 2026 Narsimha Astro · Vedic wisdom for modern life</footer>
    <script>document.querySelectorAll('.menu-toggle').forEach(button => { const nav = document.getElementById('site-navigation'); button.addEventListener('click', () => { const open = nav.classList.toggle('is-open'); button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(open)); button.setAttribute('aria-label', open ? 'Close menu' : 'Open menu') }); nav.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(link => link.addEventListener('click', () => { nav.classList.remove('is-open'); button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false') })); document.addEventListener('keydown', e => { if (e.key === 'Escape') { nav.classList.remove('is-open'); button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false') } }) })</script>
</body>

</html>